.                 * (i) coefficient estimate
.                 local coefficient = _b[has_daughter]

. 
.                 * (ii) standard error
.                 local se = _se[has_daughter]

. 
.                 * (iii) family of the test statistic (e.g. z, t, F, Chi²)
